body:
Submission record #{{PID}} has been created on the {{CONFNAME}} site.

* Title: {{TITLE}}
* Author(s): {{OPT(AUTHORS)}}
* Site: {{LINK(paper, p={{PID}}, {{AUTHORVIEWCAPABILITY}})}}

{{NOTES}}

This message confirms only that a submission record has been created. It does not mean that the submission is registered for {{CONFSHORTNAME}}. A submission is considered registered once its required registration information (title, abstract, author list, and topic choices) is complete by the registration deadline.

{{IF(REASON)}}
An administrator provided the following reason for creating this submission record: {{REASON}}
{{ELSEIF(ADMINUPDATE)}}
An administrator created this submission record.
{{ENDIF}}

Contact {{ADMIN}} with any questions or concerns.

{{SIGNATURE}}
{{LINK}}
